  "description": "The Rat's gain stage, hard clipper and Filter: an LM308 non-inverting stage with up to about 67 dB of gain (Distortion VR1; R4/C5 and R5/C6 its legs to ground), two 1N4148 to ground after R6, then the Filter knob's low-pass (VR2, R7, C8). Values and refs from ElectroSmash's \"ProCo Rat Analysis\" (electrosmash.com/proco-rat), as the Rat starter (1N4148 for the 1N914, a listed substitute). The LM308's supply is V+ here (V+F, after the filter, in the Rat). Biased from a reference voltage (vref port).",
